# Wave-7 fix (units) W7-08-01/02/03, W7-04-06/11: a drone-infested Grizzly
# is SENT to the own Service Depot by clicking the depot (enter cursor); the
# depot repairs it on its own URepairRate clock and the Terror Drone dies on
# the first paid step (ExitUnit with the suppression running, RE 0x6F4010).
set render_every 3000
set on_quit continue
click button "Single Player"
click button Skirmish
require scene == lobby
click combo:ai1
click "pick:Easy Enemy"
click check:crates
click slider:units=0
click slider:speed=2
click start
until 120 scene == game
click unit 0:AMCV
key d
until 450 built(0,GACNST) == 1
cheat reveal
cheat credits 20000
cheat w2 build GAPOWR
cheat w2 build GAPOWR
cheat place GADEPT 0 building 0:GACNST +10 0
wait 2
assert buildings(0,GADEPT) == 1
cheat spawn MTNK 0 building 0:GACNST +4 +9
cheat spawn DRON 1 building 0:GACNST +6 +9
until 200 parasited == 1
assert units(1,DRON) == 1
click unit 0:MTNK
move building 0:GADEPT
wait 1
assert cursor_name == enter
click building 0:GADEPT
until 900 units(1,DRON) == 0
assert parasited == 0
until 1500 uhpn(0,MTNK,0) == 300
assert units(0,MTNK) == 1
end
